 {
  "text": "Hey, quick voice message about last night. We played four matches. I know, it was late. We won the first two, and the second one was really close. Then we lost the third one, because I made a bad call at the end. My fault. The last one, we beat them nine to two. Nine to two! My score was the best of the week. After that I practiced the new map for an hour. Text me when you wake up.",
