 },
 {
  "text": "Okay, that is a wrap for tonight. Here is the quick recap. I started this stream with zero wins, and I finished with six. Six! I lost the first two matches, and I was not happy about it. Then something changed. I stopped rushing, I played slower, and I won five in a row. That is my best score of the season. Thanks for watching, and same time tomorrow.",
